    "body": "FWIW, the original discussion we had about that (interleaved with another about the unit of the angle) is at https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6661#discussion_r629001043   \r\n\r\nEvery participant in this thread apparently agreed that we should be consistent with the other canvas methods, but I now notice that no one from Gecko or WebKit did actually have a word on that particular point. In my original comment I noticed that Gecko's experimental implementation had the angle in radians, but I didn't say anything about what they were doing with the initial angle, nor do I remember it. In retrospect, we should probably have waited for an explicit answer from them, or at least posted a comment on their own issues.",
