    "body": "Okey okey. \r\n\r\nI see that. I was a bit confused about this, because I don't think `ctx.rotate()` has an initial angle. But yeah, `arc()` has. :)\r\n\r\nOkey, so we can drop this.\r\n\r\nThere's a [bug for Firefox](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1711171) that I've updated and I've created a [WebKit one](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=244254). \r\n",
